# Build context for apps/web/Dockerfile: an allowlist, or every app's assets and
# Rust target dirs ship to the builder. Every workspace package.json comes along
# so pnpm's frozen lockfile still sees the whole workspace.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/*/package.json
!apps/web/
!apps/desktop/CHANGELOG.md
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/.next
